
>> shop := (Lomifefiloi fou
	tuʻu: ['magazine'] i: ['books'],
	tuʻu: ['computer'] i: ['electronics'],
	tuʻu: ['lipstick'] i: ['cosmetics']
).
Tuuina-atu tusi: (shop o-i-ai: ['computer']), laina-fou. 
Tuuina-atu tusi: (shop o-i-ai: ['sausage']), laina-fou. 
Tuuina-atu tusi: (shop o-i-ai: ['computers']), laina-fou. 
Tuuina-atu tusi: (shop o-i-ai: ['compute']), laina-fou. 
Tuuina-atu tusi: (shop o-i-ai: ['2computer']), laina-fou. 
